# A proton-dependent rate uses activity, while stoichiometry spends acid equivalents
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.79g
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 Na2S2O3 0.79g
add v2 HCl 0.004mol
new
add v3 water 100mL
add v3 Na2S2O3 0.79g
add v3 HCl 0.001mol
wait 1s
inspect
